    },
    "A colorless gas with a pungent odor, primarily from burning fossil fuels (coal and oil) or volcanic activity. It irritates the respiratory system and contributes to acid rain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一種無色、刺鼻的氣體，主要來自燃燒煤炭與石油，或火山活動。會刺激呼吸道並造成酸雨。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A colorless, odorless gas from incomplete burning of fossil fuels. It reduces oxygen flow in the blood, causing dizziness, headaches, and potentially death." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一種無色無味的氣體，來自化石燃料的不完全燃燒。它會減少血液中的氧氣供應，導致頭暈、頭痛，嚴重時可能致命。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gas formed by reactions of pollutants (like nitrogen oxides and VOCs) in sunlight. In the lower atmosphere, it's a harmful pollutant that irritates the respiratory system and damages vegetation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由氮氧化物與揮發性有機物在陽光下反應而產生的氣體。在低層大氣中是有害汙染物，會刺激呼吸系統並傷害植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reddish-brown gas from burning fossil fuels. It irritates the respiratory system and contributes to ozone and acid rain formation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一種紅棕色氣體，主要來自燃燒化石燃料。會刺激呼吸系統，並促成臭氧與酸雨的形成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
