    "Taipei City Government Open Data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "臺北市資料大平臺"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taiwan Government Open Data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "政府資料開放平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AQI (Air Quality Index) is a way to measure the quality of the air you breathe, like a score based on the amounts of various pollutants in the air (typically those listed below). The values shown in this app are given by Taiwan's Ministry of Environment and run on a scale from 0 to 500, with 0 being considered clean air and 500 being hazardous.*" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AQI（空氣品質指數）是一種用來衡量空氣品質的方式，像是根據多種污染物濃度計算出的分數（通常為下方所列污染物）。本 App 顯示的數值來自台灣環境部，範圍為 0 到 500，0 表示乾淨空氣，500 則為有害。*"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The information displayed is based on the latest available data from the Taipei City Government Open Data platform. While we strive for accuracy, discrepancies may exist between the available data and real-world conditions. We are not responsible for any inaccuracies or outdated information." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本 App 所顯示的資訊來自台北市政府開放資料平台。我們致力於提供準確資訊，但實際情況可能與資料不符，對任何不準確或過時的內容，我們不負責。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The information displayed is based on the latest available data from the Taipei City/Taichung City Government Open Data platform. While we strive for accuracy, discrepancies may exist between the available data and real-world conditions. We are not responsible for any inaccuracies or outdated information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本 App 所顯示的資訊來自台北/台中市政府開放資料平台。我們致力於提供準確資訊，但實際情況可能與資料不符，對任何不準確或過時的內容，我們不負責。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app uses datasets provided by the Taiwan Government Open Data Platform and by the Taipei City Government Open Data Platform, licensed under: Open Government Data License v1.0." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本 App 使用台灣政府與台北市政府開放資料平台所提供的資料集，並依據 Open Government Data License v1.0 授權使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app uses datasets provided by the Taiwan Government Open Data Platform, the Taipei City Government Open Data Platform, and the Taichung City Government Open Data Platform, licensed under: Open Government Data License v1.0." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本 App 使用台灣政府、臺北市政府及臺中市政府開放資料平台所提供的資料集，並依據「政府資料開放授權條款‑第一版」授權使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiny particles of solid or liquid matter suspended in the air. This includes coarser particles (PM₁₀ are 10 micrometers or smaller) and fine particles (PM₂.₅ are 2.5 micrometers or smaller), both of which can penetrate deep into the lungs and cause health problems. Sources include vehicle exhaust, industrial emissions, and wildfires." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空氣中懸浮的微小固體或液體粒子。包括粗懸浮微粒（PM₁₀，直徑小於等於10微米）與細懸浮微粒（PM₂.₅，直徑小於等於2.5微米），可深入肺部並對健康造成危害。來源包括車輛排放、工業污染與野火。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While we strive to keep all information accurate and up-to-date, this app makes no guarantees about the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of the data provided. The original data is provided by third parties (including the Taiwan government) and may contain errors or become outdated. Use of this data is at your own risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我們盡力保持所有資訊的準確與即時性，但不保證資料的準確性、完整性或可靠性。原始資料由第三方（包括台灣政府）提供，可能包含錯誤或過時。使用者需自行承擔使用風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
